[00:00.000] 作词 : Wendy Eisenberg
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Wendy Eisenberg
[00:22.093] Take a number, narrow every eye
[00:25.843] So when fortune's bug-eyed monster takes your life, you might know why
[00:32.612] Tempt the good fates, see yourself in prey
[00:36.429] Let the eagle kill its dinner while you tend your fields, okay?
[00:41.408] You will come home after work lets out and feel yourself die
[00:53.985]
[01:08.444] So it's different, chiller than you thought
[01:12.064] Looks like luck's inherent humor pushed you past your sense of loss
[01:18.615] Make a good-faith effort to obey all the best advice of fortune
[01:24.583] While you twist her arm, okay?
[01:26.983] You are the oldest you've ever been
[01:32.384] Did you feel yourself change?
